Q1. Write a SQL Statement to COUNT the number of valid (i.e. Status = Approved) Outage Events sorted by their respective Outage_Reason (i.e. Forced, Consequential, Scheduled, Opportunistic) over the 2016 & 2017 Periods.

%%sql

SELECT
  COUNT(*) AS Total_Number_Outages,
  Outage_Reason,
  year
FROM AEMR_Outage_Table
WHERE Status = 'Approved'
GROUP BY
  Outage_Reason,
  year
ORDER BY
  year,
