Q3) Write a SQL statement that calculates 1) The Total_Number_Outage_Events and 2) The Average Duration in DAYS for each Participant Code and Outage Type over the 2016 and 2017 Period where the Status = Approved. Order by Total_Number_Outage_Events in Descending Order, Reason and Year.

%%sql

SELECT
  Participant_Code,
  Outage_Reason,
  year,
  COUNT(*) AS Total_Number_Outage_Events,
  ROUND(AVG(ABS(JULIANDAY(end_time) - JULIANDAY(start_time))),2) AS Average_Outage_Duration_In_Days
FROM AEMR_Outage_Table
WHERE Status = 'Approved'
GROUP BY
  Participant_Code,
  year
ORDER BY
  year ASC,
  Outage_Reason ASC,
  Total_Number_Outage_Events DESC;

