Q9) Write a SQL Statement to calculate the Average Energy Lost and Total Energy Lost for each Facility Code and Participant Code across both the 2016 and 2017 periods when the Outage_Reason is set to Forced. Upon completion of this, calculate the percentage of energy lost due to forced outages for each Facility_Code. Please ORDER the query by Total Energy Lost from 2016 to 2017.

%%sql

WITH forced AS (
  SELECT
    ROUND(AVG(Energy_Lost_MW),2) AS Avg_Energy_Lost,
    ROUND(SUM(Energy_Lost_MW),2) AS Total_Energy_Lost,
    Participant_Code,
    Facility_Code,
    Year
    FROM AEMR_Outage_Table
  WHERE
    Status = 'Approved'
    AND Outage_Reason = 'Forced'
  GROUP BY
    Participant_Code,
    Facility_Code),
facility_total AS (
  SELECT
    ROUND(SUM(Energy_Lost_MW),2) AS Total_Energy_Lost,
    Facility_Code
  FROM AEMR_Outage_Table
  WHERE Status = 'Approved'
  GROUP BY Facility_code )
SELECT
    f.Avg_Energy_Lost,
    ROUND(f.Total_Energy_Lost,2) AS Total_Energy_Lost,
    ROUND((f.Total_Energy_Lost / ft.Total_Energy_Lost) * 100,2) AS Pct_Energy_Lost,
    f.Participant_Code,
    f.Facility_Code,
    f.Year
FROM forced f
JOIN facility_total ft USING (Facility_Code)
ORDER BY Total_Energy_Lost DESC;

